  "description": {
    "en": "Wilson Revolve 17 is a round tri-polymer co-polyester featuring a low-friction additive designed to maximize string movement and snapback. Built for players with long, fast strokes, it blends easy power, comfort and spin with a clean, predictable response. At 1.25 mm / 17 gauge, it is thinner than Revolve 16 and provides enhanced feel, pocketing and responsive control while sacrificing some durability.",

    "zh": "Wilson Revolve 17 是一款采用 Tri-Polymer 三聚合物结构与低摩擦添加剂的圆形共聚酯球线。它主要通过极高的 String Movement 与 Snapback 来制造旋转，而不是依赖异形截面的机械咬球。1.25 毫米 / 17 Gauge 比 Revolve 16 更细，因此拥有更明显的 Feel、Pocketing 和响应式控制，同时依然保留 Revolve 系列突出的力量、舒适性与旋转表现，但耐久会略低于 1.30 毫米版本。"
  },

